<title>USA: Cincinnati Financial sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Cincinnati Financial sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cincinnati Financial Corp said on Monday that its board of directors approved the repurchase of up to three million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Cincinnati Financial said it has about 55.7 million outstanding shares.</p>
<p>A specific timetable for the purchases was not provided, but management is given discretion about buying the shares at &quot;prices that are deemed reasonable,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it expects that most of the purchases would be through open market transactions.</p>
</text>
